List of changes for this patch:=20
=A0
1. Fix to ensure that adapter is left enabled when link state goes down =
(called Tx/Rx supsend mode).=20
2. Make napi a load time option.=20
3. Provide ufo enable/disable option a loadable parameter.
4. Mask out some unused interrupts.=20
5. Fix bug in updating skb->truesize.
6. Fix reset handling of chip.
=A0
